<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Hannover Re.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman cuts Hannover Re.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>German reinsurance group Hannover Ruckversich was cut to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot; at Goldman Sachs, the investment bank said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- John Hanley, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
